# Product screen map authority

`docs/PRODUCT_SCREEN_MAP.md` is the authoritative source for approved product screens and approved product navigation.

Do not invent new product screens, navigation items, fields, buttons, flows, or screen-specific features beyond what that document explicitly approves.

When product requirements are missing or ambiguous, record them as open decisions instead of guessing.

Technical infrastructure screens such as bootstrap, not-found, and error handling UI are not product screens unless product requirements explicitly say otherwise.

Changes to the product screen map must be intentional and based on explicit product requirements, not implementation convenience.

Future routing in `src/app/routing` must map approved Screen IDs from `docs/PRODUCT_SCREEN_MAP.md` to technical route paths. Route configuration must not become a second product-definition source.
